{"id":"konkurrenz","lemma":"Konkurrenz","pos":"noun","rank":3286,"glosses":["competition (act of competing)","competitors, competition (rival businesses)"],"ipa":"/kɔnkʊˈʁɛnt͡s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3f/De-Konkurrenz.ogg/De-Konkurrenz.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Konkurrenz","plural":"Konkurrenzen"},"examples":[{"text":"Was macht die Konkurrenz besser?","en":"What's the competition doing better?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"good","l":"gut"}]},{"text":"Wir haben keine Angst vor Konkurrenz.","en":"We're not afraid of competition.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null]},{"text":"Ist das nicht gerade, wie Konkurrenz funktioniert?","en":"Isn't that how competition works?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"how"},null,{"g":"to work, function","l":"funktionieren"}]},{"text":"In vier Jahren wirst du keine Konkurrenz mehr haben.","en":"Four years from now, you'll have no competition.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"four (numerical value…"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"more"},{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Noch vier Jahre, und Sie haben keine Konkurrenz mehr.","en":"Four years from now, you'll have no competition.","words":[{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"four (numerical value…"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"more"}]}]}